--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party reference code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The directory docs/research/ contains source files copied verbatim from
Sunshine (https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine), which is licensed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0:

  docs/research/nvhttp.cpp
  docs/research/nvhttp.h
  docs/research/rtsp.cpp
  docs/research/stream.cpp
  docs/research/stream.h
  docs/research/input.cpp
  docs/research/main.cpp
  docs/research/crypto.cpp
  docs/research/crypto.h
  docs/research/video.cpp

These files are kept only as a protocol reference ("spec by code"). They are
not compiled into nx-server. Their copyright and license belong to the
Sunshine contributors. See docs/research/README.md for details.

The GameStream/NX protocol is implemented independently in Rust, based on the
public protocol description and on observing Moonlight/Sunshine behavior.
No NVIDIA proprietary source code is included.

