trademarks of their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by any of them.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Utilities that touch device firmware
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

tools/patch_libui_gralloc.py and scripts/fix_gadget3.sh are optional,
device-specific utilities. They modify files/configfs on an Android device
and require root/Magisk on that device. They are not needed for streaming
and are provided WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY. Use at your own risk; you are
responsible for complying with the laws and warranties that apply to your
device.
